sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Service
    participant D as DbSlice on shards
    participant E as ExecInfo

    C->>S: WATCH k
    S->>D: RegisterWatchedKey(k, &watched_dirty)
    S->>E: 记录 db/key 与 existed count
    D-->>E: key 被修改或过期时 watched_dirty=true
    C->>S: MULTI ... EXEC
    S->>E: 检查 watched_dirty
    alt 已变脏或存在性复查失败
      S-->>C: Null Array
    else 未变化
      S->>S: StartMulti + 执行 body
      S-->>C: Array replies
    end
    S->>D: UnregisterConnectionWatches
